                        ],
                        "form": "die Dorftrottel"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e1d8acc6-e1c2-300a-80e3-e9314f754522",
                        "entry_id": "efbfb3fc-97fa-399f-8b50-22f4a5caf2c5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Einwohner eines Dorfes, der in Bezug auf seine Intelligenz nicht mit anderen mithalten kann und allgemein dafür bekannt ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d60b8eb-e747-40e0-8f46-5ea43f0156a3",
                                "sense_id": "e1d8acc6-e1c2-300a-80e3-e9314f754522",
                                "text": "Ach der. Das ist nur der Dorftrottel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6331c64-72ed-42a3-ac16-ac0cf24d0a0f",
                                "sense_id": "e1d8acc6-e1c2-300a-80e3-e9314f754522",
                                "text": "„Die gewiß nicht schmerzhaften symbolischen Hiebe mit dem trockenen Blumenstengel waren geeignet, dem Neffen zu bedeuten, daß die Achtung vor anderen Menschen den Dorftrottel nicht ausschließen darf.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f961a7a-bc70-4bb4-afc9-d2e294b80b9e",
                                "sense_id": "e1d8acc6-e1c2-300a-80e3-e9314f754522",
                                "text": "„Wir hörten keine Schüsse mehr, der Dorftrottel, der allein zurückgeblieben war, konnte uns keine Auskunft geben.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29a0da4b-8839-4a71-ab6a-801d48a50729",
                        "source_entry_id": "efbfb3fc-97fa-399f-8b50-22f4a5caf2c5",
                        "source_sense_id": "e1d8acc6-e1c2-300a-80e3-e9314f754522",
                        "source_sense_description": "Einwohner eines Dorfes mit geringerer Intelligenz oder Vernunft als die Dorfgemeinschaft",
                        "target_lang_word": "village idiot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "village idiot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1af1c462-160b-34c0-9540-eea4631e812e",
                                        "entry_id": "6663b4bc-e531-3064-8d0e-31ec22f0d9d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person widely known in their community for their stupidity and ignorant behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bcdccf5-ba9e-4a19-9a11-6a8bab415c32",
                                                "sense_id": "1af1c462-160b-34c0-9540-eea4631e812e",
                                                "text": "It is true that the Doocot was occasionally appropriated to other purposes than that of a tolbooth for the sorner, the drunken gipsy, the village idiot at the change of the moon, the swearing bluegown, and the contumacious birdnester on the sabbath; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c36aa51-a919-4ba6-999b-0ae95e9f0990",
                                                "sense_id": "1af1c462-160b-34c0-9540-eea4631e812e",
                                                "text": "\"So kindly keep the vainglorious enumeration of your pots for the benefit of those village idiots who compose your particular set of boozing companions.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c343f65-f0a2-4ff7-9a7f-d2e83f5d03bd",
                                                "sense_id": "1af1c462-160b-34c0-9540-eea4631e812e",
                                                "text": "To some, Mr. Cagri was the Internet's village idiot, but others were touched by his warmth or just tickled by the absurdity of the whole phenomenon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9986d7fe-2a15-4972-802c-86b7c981ee70",
                        "source_entry_id": "efbfb3fc-97fa-399f-8b50-22f4a5caf2c5",
                        "source_sense_id": "e1d8acc6-e1c2-300a-80e3-e9314f754522",
                        "source_sense_description": "Einwohner eines Dorfes mit geringerer Intelligenz oder Vernunft als die Dorfgemeinschaft",
                        "target_lang_word": "idiot du village",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "idiot du village",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c64d50c6-9db6-382a-9379-f6ace0accd13",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5a2456-027f-3f31-ad05-49fbdd11e525",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui est simple d’esprit, atteinte d’un handicap mental."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f86021a6-25c4-4217-8438-1b5d83a7c000",
                                                "sense_id": "c64d50c6-9db6-382a-9379-f6ace0accd13",
                                                "text": "C’était évidemment un épileptique, le type même de ce que les gens des campagnes appellent l’idiot du village."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a960f7c-a551-3dc2-a466-7d0f09b0a33c",
                                        "entry_id": "0d5a2456-027f-3f31-ad05-49fbdd11e525",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne connue pour sa stupidité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3567fbb3-d62a-4788-a738-02ce41479e24",
                                                "sense_id": "6a960f7c-a551-3dc2-a466-7d0f09b0a33c",
                                                "text": "Comme l’écrivait Umberto Eco : «[…]. Aujourd’hui, l’idiot du village a le même droit de parole qu’un prix Nobel et est considéré comme un porteur de vérité »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
